  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The eyes are glossy lenses (lo_eyes) with the gold iris, the big pupil, the catchlights and the upper lash line baked into the body atlas; the brows, blush, nostrils and the wide smile are baked into the body. No face sheet and no morphs: expressions in clips' `faces` are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each lens squashes onto the closed lid's lash line and sinks into the head, showing the closed lid sculpted and painted on the skin under it. The chest's warm heart and the tail's spade are in the glow map (ORM alpha); the little flame puff of the attack is a runtime effect from socket_mouth.",
